      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have verified that with these changes, a flashrom can still program and verify the content of Winbond W25Q128.V chip using C2D2.  I have verified this both with and without the new CONFIG_USB_SPI_FLASH_EXTENSIONS, though flashrom does not use the new CMD_FLASH_TRANSFER_START, whether support is compiled in or not.",
