      "side": 1,
      "message": "Biggest concern I have is chip specific vendor commands are not clearly identified. Like this is the JEDEC protocol and elsewhere there\u0027s a few other locations. We know that there are different sequences.",
      "revId": "3dd391a2b8092fd36005f80b64c5acc33a4a97f7",
